{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501510-kigeki-short-film","id":1501510,"title":"Kigeki - Short Film","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-27T18:45:33-08:00","id":1501510,"title":"Kigeki - Short Film","content":"A beautiful short film (10 minutes), <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tYTc19rnw6o\" target=\"_blank\">Kigeki</a> got my thinking what splat is the Black Swordman?<br /> <br /> It has some Invictus air to him but it cant be a vampire as we see him in sunlight. A Changeling perhaps? A weird wizened/ogre behaviour.<br /> <br /> I would love to read your ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-28T04:24:33-08:00","id":1501528,"title":"","content":"A flurry of furious 10-second-forwards, focusing mostly on the sights rather than the words, gives me Mummy vibes. Gonna have to sit down properly to find anything concrete, though.<br /> <br /> Or an Abyssal Exalted <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-28T07:36:12-08:00","id":1501536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501510-kigeki-short-film?p=1501528#post1501528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A flurry of furious 10-second-forwards, focusing mostly on the sights rather than the words, gives me Mummy vibes. Gonna have to sit down properly to find anything concrete, though.<br /> <br /> Or an Abyssal Exalted <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Please do watch it. That is why I posted the link, beautiful goth art, simple story and the name (Kigeki means Comedy) will make sense in context.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-28T07:54:55-08:00","id":1501537,"title":"","content":"Yeah, for a best fit, this isn't Chronicles of Darkness, this is an Abyssal Exalted. The style of action of course, but also the general aloof air of the character best fits their brand of stoic dignity mixed with merciless violence.<br /> <br /> Holding strictly to the CofD, I think you were on the right track with the Invictus, perhaps a survivor of the Legio Mortuum. You're not going to find a 1-to-1 match because the books weren't written to reproduce this animated short, so the daywalking isn't really important. Just set scenes at night instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-28T10:05:45-08:00","id":1501540,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501510-kigeki-short-film?p=1501537#post1501537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, for a best fit, this isn't Chronicles of Darkness, this is an Abyssal Exalted. The style of action of course, but also the general aloof air of the character best fits their brand of stoic dignity mixed with merciless violence.<br /> <br /> Holding strictly to the CofD, I think you were on the right track with the Invictus, perhaps a survivor of the Legio Mortuum. You're not going to find a 1-to-1 match because the books weren't written to reproduce this animated short, so the daywalking isn't really important. Just set scenes at night instead.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for the comment.<br /> <br /> I was thinking about the part when <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">the Black Swordman eats the knights</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That tells me Beast or Ogre Changeling. But his elongated extremities tell me Wizened.<br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-28T17:57:07-08:00","id":1501584,"title":"","content":"Watched it in full!<br /> <br /> So yeah, an ancient vampire works. Possibly Mekhet, with an uncharacteristic focus on martial prowess. (Or maybe not so uncharacteristic \u2014 Celerity works wonders in combat).<br /> <br /> An Arisen of the Deshrem Decree also works. All three aspects of the Soaring Falcon Affinity, and the full Ba Pillar recovery condition, have been put into play. He\u2019s unusually calm and reserved for a Falcon, but hey, maybe he\u2019s just old and worn enough to only act when he decides he <i>really </i>needs to.<br /> <br /> For the Wyrd side of things, I actually think he could be Gentry. Not sure why specifically, but something clicks for me that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-29T06:55:03-08:00","id":1501606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501510-kigeki-short-film?p=1501584#post1501584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Watched it in full!<br /> <br /> So yeah, an ancient vampire works. Possibly Mekhet, with an uncharacteristic focus on martial prowess. (Or maybe not so uncharacteristic \u2014 Celerity works wonders in combat).</div> </div> </div> </div>Invictus Oaths and behaviour all the way. Except for those pesky sunlight scenes. But you mentioned even better options<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501510-kigeki-short-film?p=1501584#post1501584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">An Arisen of the Deshrem Decree also works. All three aspects of the Soaring Falcon Affinity, and the full Ba Pillar recovery condition, have been put into play. He\u2019s unusually calm and reserved for a Falcon, but hey, maybe he\u2019s just old and worn enough to only act when he decides he <i>really </i>needs to.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had not considered the Deshret option. Reading Soaring Falcon Affinity, indeed it seems a perfect fit to represent what could be happening.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1501510-kigeki-short-film?p=1501584#post1501584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For the Wyrd side of things, I actually think he could be Gentry. Not sure why specifically, but something clicks for me that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, Gentry works for the bargain &quot;Give me the thing that I long for and I will do a single task, any task, for you&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T06:40:06-08:00","id":1502925,"title":"","content":"Could be a Hollow Mekhet explaining him being seen by day but raising other questions. Might be a Strix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}